    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Easily replace or hide any footer content without editing theme files or writing custom CSS.</p>\n<h3>Notes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Simply to use 3 step wizard</li>\n<li>Simply enter what you want to change and what you want to change it to</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>, or install via the WordPress Plugins screen.  </li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the Plugins screen.  </li>\n<li>Configure your preferences on the plugin settings page.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='do%20i%20need%20to%20edit%20any%20code%20or%20write%20css%3F'>\nDo I need to edit any code or write CSS?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. Simply enter the text you want to replace and what to replace it with. The plugin handles the rest.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20this%20plugin%20modify%20theme%20or%20core%20files%3F'>\nDoes this plugin modify theme or core files?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. All changes are applied client-side. Disabling the plugin reverts to your original footer.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20javascript%20required%3F'>\nIs JavaScript required?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. JavaScript must be enabled in the browser for features like live preview and dynamic updates to function properly.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Quickly replace or hide footer content for any theme—no coding or CSS required.",
